# core is installed from JSR here, and from npm on every other runtime.
#
# Not a preference: the npm ESM build carries tsup's
# `createRequire(import.meta.url)` banner at module scope, and `import.meta.url`
# is undefined on workerd — so `@green-tea/core/edge` throws at load, before any
# of its own code runs. JSR publishes transpiled source with no bundler and no
# banner, and boots clean. See Green-Tea/core#93; once that is fixed this file
# and the `npm:@jsr/...` alias in package.json can both go.
@jsr:registry=https://npm.jsr.io
